<view class="studio">
  <text class="eyebrow">BEFORE THE GAME / 03</text>
  <text class="title">本桌怎么玩</text>
  <view class="subtitle">先把期待说清楚，再一起开局。</view>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view>
  <view wx:for="{{fields}}" wx:key="key" class="agreement-line">
    <text class="number">0{{index + 1}}</text>
    <view class="grow">
      <text class="label">{{item.label}}</text>
      <picker
        range="{{item.options}}"
        value="{{values[item.key]}}"
        data-key="{{item.key}}"
        bindchange="change"
        disabled="{{incoming || busy}}"
      >
        <view class="agreement-value">
          {{item.options[values[item.key]]}} {{incoming ? '' : '▾'}}
        </view>
      </picker>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view class="notice">这份约定不衡量套牌强度，也不替代开局前的讨论。</view>
  <view wx:if="{{!incoming}}" class="actions">
    <button bindtap="save" disabled="{{busy}}">保存本桌</button>
    <button
      class="primary"
      bindtap="publish"
      disabled="{{busy}}"
      loading="{{busy}}"
    >
      {{remote ? '更新分享约定' : '生成分享约定'}}
    </button>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{remote && !dirty}}" class="panel">
    <view class="section-title">开局确认</view>
    <view class="muted">
      {{agreement ? agreement.count + ' 位玩家已确认' : '刷新查看确认人数'}}
    </view>
    <view class="actions">
      <button class="primary" bindtap="agree" disabled="{{busy}}">
        {{agreement.agreed ? '撤回我的确认' : '我同意本桌约定'}}
      </button>
      <button open-type="share">发给牌友</button>
    </view>
    <button class="link" bindtap="refresh" disabled="{{busy}}">
      刷新确认状态
    </button>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{dirty && remote}}" class="notice">
    约定已修改，更新分享后，所有玩家需要重新确认。
  </view>
  <view class="actions">
    <button bindtap="copy">复制约定文本</button>
    <button bindtap="newTable" disabled="{{busy}}">以此新建一桌</button>
  </view>
  <button
    wx:if="{{remote && !incoming && !remote.revoked}}"
    class="link"
    bindtap="revoke"
    disabled="{{busy}}"
  >
    撤回公开约定
  </button>
  <view wx:if="{{!incoming && history.length}}" class="section">
    <view class="section-title">最近的牌桌</view>
    <button
      wx:for="{{history}}"
      wx:key="id"
      class="saved-table"
      data-id="{{item.id}}"
      bindtap="loadSaved"
      disabled="{{busy}}"
    >
      {{item.date}} · {{fields[0].options[item.values.level]}}
    </button>
  </view>
</view>
